{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b45c329298f32e86ec8cd36ee8a420bee89119df48a99ab3a2d49f573db9c58f", "ja": "しばしのお別れ", "zh": "暂别", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f4891c6dc649b45b379f445063a38533894df68bbb54d82543948454b697886", "ja": "リニューアル工事が始まり、いよいよ劇場が\n立ち入り禁止に。しかしプロデューサーの話\nをあまり聞いていなかった未来と海美は劇場\nに来てしまう。それを予想して待っていた\nこのみと可憐が、ふたりに状況を説明する。", "zh": "翻新工程开始，剧场终于\n禁止入内。然而没怎么听制作人\n说话的未来和海美还是来到了剧场。\n早已料到这一点并等候在此的\nこのみ和可怜向两人说明了情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "11e1055cb36b381d8132c8ed2dad0198f6925c3b5e6cd225b2df4f8cd3810c3a", "ja": "あれ……？\n立入禁止？　……うーん？", "zh": "咦……？\n禁止入内？……嗯——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "e40cea68e298d66cc33c0215539a9c52ca9a241e2a4b10c52fe7673800265e61", "ja": "未来ちゃん！　やっぱりこっちに来ちゃったのね。\n今日から劇場はリニューアル工事で使えなくなるの。", "zh": "未来！你果然还是跑到这边来了呀。从今天起，剧场要进行翻新施工，暂时不能使用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "32ea863d86217c17028a9c0d2c19eeb305624e76a3fcd806d88226711417ec80", "ja": "お仕事の時は直接向かう。レッスンは指定のスタジオ。\nミーティングは都内に借りてるレンタルオフィス。", "zh": "工作时直接过去。练习在指定的摄影棚进行。\n会议则在都内租用的共享办公室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "167fbf677eddbadc047ed147d4ec93159c40b1af6595b84932cb189dc4f0aea0", "ja": "昨日、{$P$}から\n言われてたでしょ。", "zh": "昨天，{$P$}跟你说过的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "33fe774835ce698998dbd010f806207f60a093c7c0564084d125e5645e25625b", "ja": "えっ、そうでしたっけ！？\nうーん……なんかそんな話してた気も……？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗！？\n嗯……好像是聊过这件事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "5e29bc06e727ab12318081adfa2b9a6d549ca4e5e0632b0dfb30d35fc0d94e10", "ja": "ミ、ミーティングの時の未来ちゃん、翼ちゃんと\nノートに落書きして、盛り上がってたかも……？", "zh": "我、我开会时可能和未来、翼一起在笔记本上乱涂乱画，聊得很起劲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e517c5e1da230541464afe01ee3dca5bde9f347413a13341db8f7ed9e777f70", "ja": "あっ、そうだったかも！　授業中に見た夢について、\n翼に話してました。すごい夢だったな～。", "zh": "啊，说不定真是那样！我在课堂上跟翼聊了聊做的梦。真是个不得了的梦啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "da707161b12e01939fa25639ecc2931f1bbd49327d65d961f0bc235609a16c38", "ja": "これは後で翼ちゃんも来そうね。", "zh": "看来翼也会在之后过来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "b977a2c3be96570c378d522ad0ccef2196ea72c5a552742a54b6c2dc7ef0d0ee", "ja": "あれ？　でも、このみさんと可憐さんもここにいるって\nことは、間違って来ちゃったんじゃないんですか～？", "zh": "咦？不过，既然木实小姐和可怜小姐也在这里，\n难道不是走错地方了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "a4711ff304bd4ed4a2c7aa7a4119103764256fa75aaa63e6f296bca9a88e8e72", "ja": "ち、違うよ……私たちは、色々と必要なものを、\nスタジオに運ぶ手伝いをしに来てただけで……。", "zh": "不、不是的……我们只是来帮忙把各种必需品搬到摄影棚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ac93dc9967ca330887fa8f1e38d6817494384f5798d7e4a9fd2aa73a375cf10", "ja": "そうしたらこのみさんが、間違って来る子が\nいるかもだから、す、少し待ってようって……。", "zh": "然后，可、可露丽小姐说，可能会有走错地方的孩子过来，所以我、我们就想着稍微等一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "b7e6c169a6fe2b0241b0c35b013f96576b316745cce69665e3921c3769bf802e", "ja": "案の定だったようね。たぶんまだ来るわよ。", "zh": "果然如此呢。恐怕还会有人来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "bdfe8d9f96b926492651c982007bb8122d445d9340785b87a5cd5aeaf6dcf6e8", "ja": "た、立入禁止……！？\nどうして！？　劇場のみんなは……！？", "zh": "禁、禁止入内……！？\n为什么！？剧场的大家……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc22f1abf2e249af6065f85e8f147dc920f496d7b3170fafbd550051056f05e2", "ja": "あーっ！　海美さんもひっかかってる！", "zh": "啊——！海美也被拦住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "6ecba624c3583009e0e95e09d9be84e55a1b3045deaaf0ed78d9d1418d1d5757", "ja": "未来ちゃん、な、なんだかうれしそう……。", "zh": "未来，你、你看起来好像很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "37efad1f24d8c82489ca61a2ba25bad92ffc9230b226e503a72cea137b61659c", "ja": "えーっ！？　なになに、これってみらいっちの罠なの？\nよくわかんないけど、やーらーれーたー！", "zh": "诶——！？什么什么，这是未来的陷阱吗？\n虽然不太明白，但我中招啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "0ddb74968062861015844bdcb077408e8f3d4e6ce5ff32d31158f4e32f74824a", "ja": "違う違う！　あのね海美ちゃん、今日から……", "zh": "不是不是！那个，海美，从今天开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "5aaff691f88149059badfe0dc12dc269f90ce758823fd86c99000fd40f828a75", "ja": "そっかそっか！　劇場のリニューアル工事……。\nそういえばそんな話、してたね！", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此！剧场的翻修工程……  \n说起来，之前确实提到过这件事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_05_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "9e9affcd9547148613f837365f61349ac45ef7eed1d2c65843079f107df3125e", "ja": "慣れ親しんだ劇場とも、しばらくお別れかぁ……。\nでも、すぐに帰ってくるから！　待っててねーっ☆", "zh": "要和熟悉的剧场暂时分别了啊……\n不过，我们很快就会回来的！等着我们哦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
